Package: perkinsos
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Max Perkins
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: @DEPENDS@, foot, fonts-dejavu-core
Recommends: fonts-noto-core, fonts-noto-cjk, fonts-noto-color-emoji, xdg-desktop-portal, xdg-desktop-portal-gtk, xwayland, mako-notifier, libnotify-bin, pipewire-audio, wireplumber, gnome-keyring, libsecret-tools, mate-polkit, pkexec, gsettings-desktop-schemas, adwaita-icon-theme, librsvg2-common, swaylock, swayidle, wayland-utils, brightnessctl, python3
Suggests: pavucontrol, greetd, tuigreet
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Description: cockpit-styled Wayland desktop
 PerkinsOS is a desktop for one laptop: a Wayland compositor forked from
 TinyWL (wlroots 0.19), with a fighter-cockpit wallpaper, a dock and an
 app launcher. Start it with perkinsos-start from a console login, or
 from a login manager such as greetd.
